      "timestamp_epoch_ms": 1526330323000,
      "timestamp_raw": "May 14, 2018 15:38:43 GMT -5",
      "body_html": "Aiite Dex-dawg, it's been a long time since yall homies asked, but it's taken a dang long time for these to finally produce traps again!  Some new pics, photos taken mostly on 5/14/18.  The first three photos are of an extraordinary division from one of my mother plants-can't figure out which mother plant it is!  I had to keep this division cuz dude, if that ain't extreme, I don't know what is! I had one other division of this plant and some lucky soul just got a copy of this stand out clone....MW doesn't keep them all <img alt=\":)\" class=\"smile\" src=\"//storage.proboards.com/forum/images/smiley/smiley.png\"/><br/><a href=\"https://postimg.cc/image/s45utjww7/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://s7.postimg.cc/3nnoz2w5n/IMG_6268.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a><br/><br/><a href=\"https://postimg.cc/image/okjx3r1w7/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://s7.postimg.cc/tvytognyz/IMG_6269.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a><br/><br/><a href=\"https://postimg.cc/image/7wsf19u9z/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://s7.postimg.cc/3nnoz3r0r/IMG_6270.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a><br/><br/><a href=\"https://postimg.cc/image/iwdmcwuzr/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://s7.postimg.cc/eahi4k9gr/IMG_6295.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a><br/><br/><a href=\"https://postimg.cc/image/6ui8iqj6f/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://s7.postimg.cc/iwdmcvsez/IMG_6296.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a><br/><br/><a href=\"https://postimg.cc/image/m385wisaf/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://s7.postimg.cc/779moxgvv/IMG_6297.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a><br/><br/><a href=\"https://postimg.cc/image/b3mykxhav/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://s7.postimg.cc/w0j6plfbv/IMG_6303.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a><br/><br/><a href=\"https://postimg.cc/image/w0j6pks6f/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\