      "body_text": "Aiite Dex-dawg, it's been a long time since yall homies asked, but it's taken a dang long time for these to finally produce traps again!  Some new pics, photos taken mostly on 5/14/18.  The first three photos are of an extraordinary division from one of my mother plants-can't figure out which mother plant it is!  I had to keep this division cuz dude, if that ain't extreme, I don't know what is! I had one other division of this plant and some lucky soul just got a copy of this stand out clone....MW doesn't keep them all",
