    {
      "post_id": 37338,
      "author_username": "gotsarrs",
      "author_user_id": 865,
      "timestamp_iso": "2018-05-21T22:14:46+00:00",
      "timestamp_epoch_ms": 1526940886000,
      "timestamp_raw": "May 21, 2018 17:14:46 GMT -5",
      "body_html": "Wow! That's really cool Mike. The throats on the two I got from you get that red, but the tubes have never shown any tint of red. My plants are still pretty small though so I'll be keeping a close eye on them as they grow to see if they turn red in the coming seasons. Fingers crossed.  ",
      "body_text": "Wow! That's really cool Mike. The throats on the two I got from you get that red, but the tubes have never shown any tint of red. My plants are still pretty small though so I'll be keeping a close eye on them as they grow to see if they turn red in the coming seasons. Fingers crossed.",
