      "body_html": "Here's Super ERT, although this year, the body didn't color up right away like it did last year.  Phenotypic variance in color and shape is \"totally extreme....man!\"  however, those heavy veins under the lid are a dominant feature.   Pics taken 5/7/19:<br/><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/47008500054_413af1fd16_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/47008499824_b0e14412df_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/47745530252_536d136dcc_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/>",
      "body_text": "Here's Super ERT, although this year, the body didn't color up right away like it did last year.  Phenotypic variance in color and shape is \"totally extreme....man!\"  however, those heavy veins under the lid are a dominant feature.   Pics taken 5/7/19:",
